# Helcurt, Shadowbringer

> Helcurt is not a burst assassin who happens to be invisible. He is a stalker: every ability exists to control when the enemy sees him, to reward the moment they finally do, and to let him vanish after each kill. Draft him when your team can strike a blind enemy, and bench him when someone on the other side can burn the fog away.

