## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when chain crowd control is the main reason Helcurt cannot finish after the first blink.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use while ahead against low-control drafts where one more raw damage slot decides the backline kill.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when a shield and movement burst protect the first dive better than a revive.
- Total cost: 11180 gold

Default jungle setup for converting Dark Night Falls into one isolated carry kill, then using Flame Retribution and Hunter Strike tempo to exit or chase the reset.

### Roam Dire Hit Burst (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy lacks reliable point-click lockdown and Helcurt's job is constant fog-to-lane pressure.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use before the final Lord fight when dying after one pick would lose more value than the last damage slot adds.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners keep the target above Sky Piercer's execute threshold.
- Total cost: 11230 gold

Damage-roam setup for coordinated pickoff games without taking jungle economy. Prowler movement keeps Force stacking between fights, so Deadly Stinger opens loaded and Petrify plus the darkness hold the target in place for the follow-up.

### Anti-Frontline Stinger DPS (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blade of the Heptaseas over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy sustain threat is low and Helcurt can still reach a squishy target from fog.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when the frontline is already cracked and the next fight is about deleting the exposed carry.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use when magic burst is killing Helcurt before Demon Hunter Sword and Corrosion Scythe can stack value.
- Total cost: 11170 gold

Anti-frontline jungle setup for games where Helcurt cannot one-tap the backline and must use stinger stacks, attack effects, and Malefic Roar to fight through durable targets.

